      "id": "DataLinq.Snowflake",
      "range": "*"
    },
    "message": "This package has been renamed to DataLinq.Snowflake. All development, bug fixes, and new features continue under the new name. The rename aligns with the parent framework rebrand from DataFlow.NET to DataLinq.NET, resolving naming conflicts with Google Cloud Dataflow and System.Threading.Tasks.Dataflow (TPL).\nTo migrate: Install DataLinq.Snowflake v1.0.1+, then update your using statements from using DataFlow; to using DataLinq; and using DataFlow.SnowflakeQuery; to using DataLinq.SnowflakeQuery;. The API surface is identical — only the namespace changed.",
    "reasons": [
      "Other"
    ]
  },
